```js
const seasons = useMemo(
  () => [...new Set(episodes.map((e) => e.season))].sort((a, b) => a - b),
  [episodes]
);
```

Also, the `eps` filter: `episodes.filter((e) => e.season === (seasons.length ? season : 1))` — if the seasons array is broken, this will be an issue too. Let me fix the useMemo.

